			dependencies: ["7CCED407A4BB55AC"]
			description: ["&n&6                                                 &r\\n\\n&6Info&f: The market system is not yet implemented but will be available in the next update. Currently, you can claim a free vendor block and sharestone. The vendor block will serve as your personal shop, allowing others to buy from you. The sharestone is connected to the same network, enabling you to teleport to each other’s shops!\\n&n&6                                                 &r\\n\\n&fThe market system uses a unique currency with different denominations. The values are as follows:\\n&6Spur &f> &61⚙\\n&6Bevel &f> &68⚙\\n&6Sprocket &f> &616⚙\\n&6Cog &f> &664⚙\\n&6Crown &f> &6512⚙\\n&6Sun &f> &64096⚙\\n&fThese currencies will be used for transactions in the upcoming market system, making trade and commerce easy and efficient!\\n&n&6                                                 &r\\n"]
